{"id": "w0010", "term": "属", "char_count": 1, "correct": "asked me", "distractors": [{"text": "belonged to me", "error_type": "char_decompose", "explanation": "按今义「属于」拆解，未辨出通『嘱』，丢了托付义"}, {"text": "told me", "error_type": "sense_shift", "explanation": "把「嘱」弱化为一般的「告诉」，抹去「托付、请托」的分量"}, {"text": "wrote it for me", "error_type": "wrong_sense", "explanation": "「属」另有「撰写」义（属文），此处是嘱托我写，不是替我写"}]}
{"id": "w0082", "term": "绝", "char_count": 1, "correct": "without cease", "distractors": [{"text": "cut off", "error_type": "char_decompose", "explanation": "取「绝」本义「切断」，用于道路；本句是往来不断"}, {"text": "crossed the river", "error_type": "wrong_sense", "explanation": "「绝」有「横渡」义（绝江河），本句并非渡水"}, {"text": "died out", "error_type": "wrong_sense", "explanation": "「绝」有「灭绝」义，用于国祚家族，本句指人流不断"}]}
{"id": "w0808", "term": "私", "char_count": 1, "correct": "privately", "distractors": [{"text": "selfishly", "error_type": "wrong_sense", "explanation": "「私」在「莫不私王」中是「偏爱」，本句是「私下」"}, {"text": "without leave", "error_type": "wrong_sense", "explanation": "「私」有「私自、擅自」义，本句强调「暗中」而非「擅权」"}, {"text": "personally", "error_type": "sense_shift", "explanation": "「亲自」与「私下」不同：原文燕王是暗中拉拢，不是亲自出面"}]}
